instance/
static/uploads/*
!static/uploads/.gitkeep
__pycache__/
# Every throwaway database a check makes, not just the smoke suite's
# one: the browser checks name theirs per file (test_ebwa_header.db,
# test_ebwa_marquee.db, ...) and the header one does not always get to
# delete it, so `git add -A` could sweep a database into the repository.
tests/test_*.db*

# axe-core for the accessibility check: half a megabyte of third-party
# minified JavaScript, fetched on demand by tests/check_accessibility.py.
# This project has no npm and no build step, and vendoring it would put
# a dependency in the repository that nothing else here needs.
tests/vendor/
*.pyc
venv/
.env

# OS file-manager clutter
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Backup archives: they contain the whole database, personal data and
# all, plus every upload. They belong on the server and in whatever the
# nightly job copies them to — never in the repository.
backups/
